{"ts": 1791255305.377322, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. For Friday\u2019s build, the key requirements are:\n1) define the environment clearly: state, observations, actions, and dynamics;\n2) report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.\n\nQuick clarification:\n- pass@k = at least one success out of k\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed\n- attention is relevant conceptually for the readings, but the build ask I found does not mention you needing a separate attention section.\n\nLet\u2019s make sure you can explain the environment piece. In one sentence each, tell me what the state, observations, and actions are in your project.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\nStudent: I don't really get pomdp yet\n[activity] t=21 messages 4m", "t": 25, "activity": [{"t": 21, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.3228359958111837, "pass_k": 0.20282525443759936}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7143091835012587, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.45602770298460465, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
