{"ts": 1791255307.032495, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Absolutely \u2014 here\u2019s the short answer:\n\nA POMDP is a problem where the agent cannot directly see the full state of the world. Instead, it sees observations, so it has to keep a belief about what state it might be in. Sometimes the best action is to gather more information, even if that costs something.\n\nFor your build, the environment definition should include:\n- State: the full situation you care about\n- Observations: what the agent can actually see\n- Actions: what the agent can do\n- Dynamics: how the state changes\n\nAnd the evaluation requirement is:\n- report pass^k on at least 3 seeds\n\nIf you want, I can help you map those four pieces to your specific project right now.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3_environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pomdp?", "t": 29, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.32931114721042654, "pass_k": 0.20282525443759936}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7043091835012587, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.5360277029846047, "persistence": 0.3448076887655993, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255308.394115, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 the next step is to write your build\u2019s environment definition in plain language, then check that you can report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.\n\nFor POMDP, the answer is:\nA POMDP is a partially observable Markov decision process. It means the agent does not get to see the full true state, only observations. Because of that, it has to infer what state it is likely in, and sometimes take actions to reduce uncertainty.\n\nIf you want, send me a 1-2 sentence description of your project, and I\u2019ll help you turn it into state / observations / actions / dynamics.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3_environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=29 idle 1m", "t": 30, "activity": [{"t": 29, "app": "idle", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.32931114721042654, "pass_k": 0.20282525443759936}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7083091835012587, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.5360277029846047, "persistence": 0.3448076887655993, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 1, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255309.388042, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Sure \u2014 the answer for POMDP is: a partially observable Markov decision process. In one sentence: the agent cannot directly observe the full state, so it uses observations to maintain a belief about the state and may act to gather more information.\n\nFor your build, the minimum thing to finish is still: define your environment as state / observations / actions / dynamics, and report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3_environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pomdp?\n[activity] t=30 messages 1m", "t": 31, "activity": [{"t": 30, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.33560982397329425, "pass_k": 0.20282525443759936}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7083091835012587, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.6160277029846046, "persistence": 0.3148076887655993, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 1.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
